    "Defense Attributes": "Fire 20, Water 20, Wind 53, Earth 20, Holy 20, Unholy 20",
    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 The Water Spirit, he was born with Innadril's strong water spirits and loved by Goddess Eva. Reckless and petty, he enjoys evil tricks such as switching infants and causing floods in the middle of the night. To protect him from anyone seeking revenge, Eva gave him Guardian Spirits. Fairies Lv. 13 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Fairies. M. Def. +5% Atk. Spd. +5% Resistance to Wind +10% Resistance to Speed Down -20% Max HP -5% Resistance to Earth -10% Water Resistance Lv. 5 Resistant to Water attacks. Fire Vulnerability Lv. 1 Vulnerable to Fire attacks. Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
